==Battleground==
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns.
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns.
