**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns.
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with this stage is to use many meatshields and to deal with the Boraphims as fast as possible. In order to do so, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and a [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controller]] like [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Magica Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] are strongly recommended, and so are [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] and [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] who can take care of the peons. Once the Boraphims are gone, losing becomes near-impossible, as long as you keep spamming stuff.

